url: "https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds"
abstract: >-
  Community research on integer multiplication with conditional kappa =
  472154791/1000000000000 = 0.000472154791. The selected construction composes
  DaysSky’s recycled registers, hpst3r’s terminal elimination, Th0rgal’s gauge
  selection and gupt1156’s stopping parameter, with SovereignSteak’s parallel
  composition and further atom refinement, building on
  icekylinx's paired-cube motif, recursive compiler and integration with
  an664's completed-core sharing, eumemic's producer, Zhihao Chen's physical
  bit ledger and Swapnil Jain's underlying word and lifted frames. The
  retained OpenAI #109 analytic and fixed-tape interfaces remain assumed.
  Finite checks and written maintainer review do not constitute a formal
  proof of multiplication or independent human peer review.
